  "description": "Famous actor Kim Seong-Jae follows a suspicious man claiming to be his temporary manager, only to arrive at a remote village he escaped from at fifteen - the compound of a cult that once consumed his life. As Seong-Jae attempts to flee the place haunted by his past, a fatal mistake leaves the cult leader dead by his hand. Moments later, the followers arrive, forcing Seongjae into an irreversible decision to survive. Trapped on a stage where faith, violence, and performance blur, Seong-Jae realizes the man who led him here has been directing everything from the shadows. Once the cameras begin to roll, there is no cutting the scene short. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
